585				<h2>Welcome to Accessible HTML5</h2>
586				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
587				<p>
588					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
589					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
590				</p>
